    {
      "id": "demo_01",
      "file": "demo_01.mp3",
      "text": "This is InsightGen, the insight generation agent in Blue Orbit. We start by creating a workspace and enabling Lumi MCP and analytical skills.",
      "text_sha256": "19f62167f28a2c84c22cd23e0954950383f8407fcd3b56b93590e9396b87bc0e",
      "voice_fingerprint": "ec40152006b304b2a24c01ad7ec644c5c224824cc231927f0c5cc72c9d9af47e",
      "api_voice_id": "English_ConfidentWoman",
      "api_speed": 1.04,
      "api_pitch": -1,
      "key_name": "MINIMAX_KEY_2",
      "natural_duration_seconds": 9.845261,
      "nominal_start_seconds": 0,
      "nominal_end_seconds": 12,
      "nominal_window_seconds": 12,
      "window_overrun_seconds": 0,
      "full_decode": "passed",
      "sha256": "9f586c154ab09316208071406fcc827486348dc29c9ec05660e3769549d58a3f",
      "tempo_adjustment": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "demo_02",
      "file": "demo_02.mp3",
      "text": "We ask for a year-over-year comparison of dollar C-sixty trends for Charge and Lend. Before proceeding, the agent clarifies the methodology, metric, and analytical depth.",
      "text_sha256": "676bc1b2dad2d2eedc03650598961beed25af4c3c0229c1f9a9bb762c863fcfc",
      "voice_fingerprint": "ec40152006b304b2a24c01ad7ec644c5c224824cc231927f0c5cc72c9d9af47e",
      "api_voice_id": "English_ConfidentWoman",
      "api_speed": 1.04,
      "api_pitch": -1,
      "key_name": "MINIMAX_KEY_2",
      "natural_duration_seconds": 10.33288,
      "nominal_start_seconds": 12,
      "nominal_end_seconds": 23,
      "nominal_window_seconds": 11,
      "window_overrun_seconds": 0,
      "full_decode": "passed",
      "sha256": "964d5d34248bc320d323ed9213367bbbacea3724f7cc0f6f698a20a3e9e23efa",
      "tempo_adjustment": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "demo_03",
      "file": "demo_03.mp3",
      "text": "It consults the governed knowledge bundle for metric definitions, calculation rules, and source tables, before querying the data and running the analysis.",
      "text_sha256": "d9f6787fb15af279d1cc0deb1cc5f699255291e0f65ae27682b6a050903e52c5",
      "voice_fingerprint": "ec40152006b304b2a24c01ad7ec644c5c224824cc231927f0c5cc72c9d9af47e",
      "api_voice_id": "English_ConfidentWoman",
      "api_speed": 1.04,
      "api_pitch": -1,
      "key_name": "MINIMAX_KEY_2",
      "natural_duration_seconds": 9.636281,
      "nominal_start_seconds": 23,
      "nominal_end_seconds": 33,
      "nominal_window_seconds": 10,
      "window_overrun_seconds": 0,
      "full_decode": "passed",
      "sha256": "57ce633928808406ff93754ff5d1fe14668bc2b16b9aa0b10ec6ccaef9362133",
      "tempo_adjustment": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "demo_04",
      "file": "demo_04.mp3",
      "text": "The report opens with key findings and a like-for-like comparison. Both products show modest improvement. Linked references open business definitions directly in the governed knowledge bundle.",
      "text_sha256": "595b3cf1125df2afd497e45658a928d533659444140049bb5a77211dc8e2db15",
      "voice_fingerprint": "ec40152006b304b2a24c01ad7ec644c5c224824cc231927f0c5cc72c9d9af47e",
      "api_voice_id": "English_ConfidentWoman",
      "api_speed": 1.04,
      "api_pitch": -1,
      "key_name": "MINIMAX_KEY_2",
      "natural_duration_seconds": 11.029478,
      "nominal_start_seconds": 33,
      "nominal_end_seconds": 47,
      "nominal_window_seconds": 14,
      "window_overrun_seconds": 0,
      "full_decode": "passed",
      "sha256": "67292ef80a8b0e5281e9c8ad1d3ccb77630dbcee458e5af5a97d479e1d04ab50",
      "tempo_adjustment": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "demo_05",
      "file": "demo_05.mp3",
      "text": "Interactive previews make the monthly patterns easy to inspect, with separate views for Charge and Lend and clear year-over-year comparisons.",
      "text_sha256": "07f2fdd6af689e2d3d33c1aa838d1755cbda1866225aa3a466c40033993ee032",
      "voice_fingerprint": "ec40152006b304b2a24c01ad7ec644c5c224824cc231927f0c5cc72c9d9af47e",
      "api_voice_id": "English_ConfidentWoman",
      "api_speed": 1.04,
      "api_pitch": -1,
      "key_name": "MINIMAX_KEY_2",
      "natural_duration_seconds": 8.243084,
      "nominal_start_seconds": 47,
      "nominal_end_seconds": 58,
      "nominal_window_seconds": 11,
      "window_overrun_seconds": 0,
      "full_decode": "passed",
      "sha256": "c732152bab8d3fce956bdbb1a33ba7a7bd3fb9e916e477ab2b500628368e2828",
      "tempo_adjustment": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "demo_06",
      "file": "demo_06.mp3",
      "text": "The supporting SQL, data extracts, and charts are linked alongside the report, so we can inspect the underlying evidence.",
      "text_sha256": "321d0aab12cdbcdf2bae96ebf14f32a87c8f5d8694d18dfe3fc9fad15458f2be",
      "voice_fingerprint": "ec40152006b304b2a24c01ad7ec644c5c224824cc231927f0c5cc72c9d9af47e",
      "api_voice_id": "English_ConfidentWoman",
      "api_speed": 1.04,
      "api_pitch": -1,
      "key_name": "MINIMAX_KEY_2",
      "natural_duration_seconds": 7.093696,
      "nominal_start_seconds": 58,
      "nominal_end_seconds": 67,
      "nominal_window_seconds": 9,
      "window_overrun_seconds": 0,
      "full_decode": "passed",
      "sha256": "d3bc69d5997dd1d709c83e68fe1dbab73c846c5c3ae98942fc4ae8b79f865181",
      "tempo_adjustment": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "demo_07",
      "file": "demo_07.mp3",
      "text": "Next, we ask what might explain the second-quarter improvement. InsightGen ranks candidate hypotheses, spelling out their mechanisms, expected signals, and tests, rather than jumping straight to a conclusion.",
      "text_sha256": "fcdb16eca620d2d7957fe6e73617d4be7cdedae52f8f86fc9c8e2a108c1e7af0",
      "voice_fingerprint": "ec40152006b304b2a24c01ad7ec644c5c224824cc231927f0c5cc72c9d9af47e",
      "api_voice_id": "English_ConfidentWoman",
      "api_speed": 1.04,
      "api_pitch": -1,
      "key_name": "MINIMAX_KEY_2",
      "natural_duration_seconds": 14.236735,
      "nominal_start_seconds": 67,
      "nominal_end_seconds": 80,
      "nominal_window_seconds": 13,
      "window_overrun_seconds": 1.2367349999999995,
      "full_decode": "passed",
      "sha256": "6c6a3510eb35fc12f4fccf60bdd9a65b3d03553d0ae3aa9582d00a1605081568",
      "tempo_adjustment": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "demo_08",
      "file": "demo_08.mp3",
      "text": "We ask it to test the top two. The results reject favorable portfolio mix as the explanation and find repayment behavior supportive for Charge, but not Lend.",
      "text_sha256": "7767d8abb5747ea8dd07a112032e8e42dfbe50f38c63eafbef069586a190d2b4",
      "voice_fingerprint": "ec40152006b304b2a24c01ad7ec644c5c224824cc231927f0c5cc72c9d9af47e",
      "api_voice_id": "English_ConfidentWoman",
      "api_speed": 1.04,
      "api_pitch": -1,
      "key_name": "MINIMAX_KEY_2",
      "natural_duration_seconds": 10.623129,
      "nominal_start_seconds": 80,
      "nominal_end_seconds": 92,
      "nominal_window_seconds": 12,
      "window_overrun_seconds": 0,
      "full_decode": "passed",
      "sha256": "462eeb56b6792436f57ebd9ace4acb6d56b0a7634fd5d0ff283f61f60931c7dd",
      "tempo_adjustment": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "demo_09",
      "file": "demo_09.mp3",
      "text": "Finally, InsightGen brings the investigation together: an executive summary, decisive charts, supporting evidence, and recommended next steps.",
